doc:Factsabstract1 None:has_text_value "Anti-friction bearings are fundamental components of rotating machines. In bearing condition monitoring, fault detection is a primary task... The study provides a basis for sensor selection in bearing condition monitoring and fault detection to enhance the reliability of industrial maintenance activities." .
